      "writtenOn": "2024-12-02T21:50:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If data path is not `DATA_PATH_NO_OFFLOAD`, BLUETOOTH_PRIVILEGED permission is enforced in BluetoothSocketManagerBinder.java under server process.\n\nhttps://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Bluetooth/+/3349374/49/android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/btservice/BluetoothSocketManagerBinder.java\n\n```\npublic ParcelFileDescriptor connectSocketwithOffload\n\u003d\u003d snip \u003d\u003d\n        if (dataPath !\u003d BluetoothSocketSettings.DATA_PATH_NO_OFFLOAD) {\n            mService.enforceCallingOrSelfPermission(BLUETOOTH_PRIVILEGED, null);\n            if (type !\u003d BluetoothSocket.TYPE_LE || !mService.isLeCocSocketOffloadSupported()) {\n                throw new IllegalStateException(\"Unsupported socket type for offload \" + type);\n            }\n        }\n```\n```\npublic ParcelFileDescriptor createSocketChannelWithOffload\n\u003d\u003d snip \u003d\u003d\n        if (dataPath !\u003d BluetoothSocketSettings.DATA_PATH_NO_OFFLOAD) {\n            mService.enforceCallingOrSelfPermission(BLUETOOTH_PRIVILEGED, null);\n            if (type !\u003d BluetoothSocket.TYPE_LE || !mService.isLeCocSocketOffloadSupported()) {\n                throw new IllegalStateException(\"Unsupported socket type for offload \" + type);\n            }\n        }\n```",
      "parentUuid": "773b2741_c6a7686c",
